  "as_of_notes": "Data 'as of' June 1, 2025 (report titled 'June 1, 2025 Six Month Summary Report'; report generated/dated 03-Sep-2025). This is the most recent voter registration report published on the TN SOS Elections Statistics page (sos.tn.gov/elections/statistics) as of June 2026; no December 2025 report had been posted yet (probe of RptSixMonthSumDec2025.pdf returned 403). Total registered per county = ENDING ACTIVE + ENDING INACTIVE, per the report's footnote 'ENDING ACTIVE PLUS ENDING INACTIVE EQUALS TOTAL REGISTRATION'.",
  "data_quality": "high",
  "notes": "Tennessee does not register voters by party; party fields are null. Per-county total_registered = ending active + ending inactive registrations. Statewide total 4,687,819 = ending active 4,340,096 + ending inactive 347,723; both column sums verified against the report's Grand Total line and the per-county sums match exactly. All 95 counties included. Integers only."
